---
title: Sequence — Generate Test (API · UI · Performance)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (CLI/Web)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Plan as TestPlanCreator
    participant Agent as AgenticHarness
    participant KB as KBOrchestrator
    participant Ctx as ContextLayer<br/>(Extractor·Synth·Feature·MindMap)
    participant LLM as ModelAPIConnector
    participant ApiG as APITestGen
    participant UiG as UITestGen
    participant PerfG as PerfTestGen
    participant Mock as MockDataCreator
    participant Val as Validator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>API: POST /generate {feature, suites:[api,ui,perf]}
    API->>Plan: create_plan(feature, suites)
    Plan->>Agent: start_session(goal=plan)
    Agent->>KB: query(feature, related_tickets, code_paths)
    KB-->>Agent: docs + embeddings + metadata
    Agent->>Ctx: extract + synthesize + build mind map
    Ctx->>LLM: prompt(extract entities / ACs)
    LLM-->>Ctx: structured features + scenarios
    Ctx-->>Agent: FeatureGraph + ScenarioTree
    Agent->>LLM: prompt(build TestPlan from scenarios)
    LLM-->>Agent: TestPlan(priority, coverage, risks)
    Agent-->>Plan: TestPlan
    Plan->>DB: persist(plan_id, plan)
    Plan-->>API: plan_id

    par API suite
        Plan->>ApiG: generate(plan, openapi_spec)
        ApiG->>LLM: prompt(test cases per endpoint)
        LLM-->>ApiG: pytest/RestAssured test files
        ApiG->>Mock: request fixtures(schema, constraints)
        Mock->>LLM: realistic data prompt
        LLM-->>Mock: payloads
        Mock-->>ApiG: fixtures.json
        ApiG-->>Val: api_tests + fixtures
    and UI suite
        Plan->>UiG: generate(plan, dom_snapshot, journeys)
        UiG->>LLM: prompt(Playwright POM + steps)
        LLM-->>UiG: page objects + spec files
        UiG->>Mock: request test users / seed data
        Mock-->>UiG: seed dataset
        UiG-->>Val: ui_tests + seed
    and Performance suite
        Plan->>PerfG: generate(plan, SLAs, traffic profile)
        PerfG->>LLM: prompt(k6 scenarios)
        LLM-->>PerfG: k6 scripts (load·stress·soak)
        PerfG->>Mock: request data pool size N
        Mock-->>PerfG: bulk dataset
        PerfG-->>Val: perf_scripts + dataset
    end

    Val->>Val: syntax · smell · coverage checks
    Val->>LLM: LLM-as-judge (quality, ambiguity)
    LLM-->>Val: score + suggestions
    alt score < threshold
        Val->>ApiG: regenerate(failed_cases)
        Val->>UiG: regenerate(failed_cases)
        Val->>PerfG: regenerate(failed_cases)
    end
    Val->>DB: persist(test_artifacts, scores)
    Val-->>API: artifacts_ref
    API-->>User: 201 {plan_id, artifacts_ref}
